blurry-b 2026-11-26: hero.png is the game's own Pawnbarian class art from the Pawnbarian Fandom wiki (https://pawnbarian.fandom.com/wiki/File:Pawnbarian_(class).png, 328px transparent), re-traced clean at 512px. end_turn, heart_empty, loot_bag, up_shield re-traced to clean vector shapes (palette-quantised, potrace, re-rendered as a 512px transparent PNG at ~90%, hard anti-aliased edges, no fading; tool tools/sprite_vec.py) from the existing video crop, because no copy of the same image was found online. heart_full.png: the video crop was clipped on the left, so it is a composite of the clean heart_empty outline filled with the heart_full colours.
sync-qa 2026-11-26: loot_crystal.png / loot_gold.png = Pawnbarian's own gem / gold nugget (official press-kit screenshot, already cut at 512px for Kzt9ItpGtYg by blurry-a; the old crystal crop was clipped). up_cantrip/up_csplash/up_dsplash.png re-traced clean at 512px (tools/sprite_vec.py). Unused heart.png, horned_bear.png deleted.
